<h1 style="font-size:20px;margin:0 0 16px;">{{tenant_name}}</h1>
<p>Hello,</p>
<p>The entity {{tenant_name}} has used <strong>{{usage_percent}}</strong> of its storage quota, above the alert threshold of {{threshold_percent}}.</p>
<p>Storage used: {{used_size}} out of {{quota_size}}.</p>
<p>When the quota is fully used, new deposits are refused until space is freed by expired or deleted transfers. You can delete transfers that are no longer needed, or ask the super administrator for a larger quota.</p>
<p><a href="{{admin_link}}" style="padding:12px 20px;background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;border-radius:4px;">Open the administration</a></p>
<p>If the button does not work, copy this address into your browser:<br><span style="word-break:break-all;">{{admin_link}}</span></p>
<hr style="border:0;border-top:1px solid #767676;margin:24px 0 16px;">
<p style="font-size:14px;color:#4a4a4a;">This message was sent automatically by {{tenant_name}}. Please do not reply to it.</p>
